abstract: "AI-drafted; maintained by Gunhee Cho. This atlas indexes claims in a pinned Lean development, written expositions, checker evidence and open questions. Paper v8 outlines the conditional deduction and writes out selected steps in full, and blueprint v13c develops the original inputs. Each edition records individual steps for readers to check by hand. Text and data are licensed under CC BY 4.0 and scripts under MIT. AI-written draft; AI cross-reviewed; no human review; not a claim that RH is proved."
references:
  - type: unpublished
    title: "Toward a human verification of Alpöge's Lean proof of the Riemann hypothesis, I: the conditional chain from Selmer windows to zero-free regions"
